### REGISTER USER
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "mypassword123"
}

###

### LOGIN USER
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "mypassword123"
}

###

### GET CURRENT USER
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer <token>

###

### GET ALL MOVIES
GET http://localhost:3000/movies

###

### GET MOVIE BY ID
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/1

###

### CREATE MOVIE
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Interstellar",
  "genre": "Sci-Fi",
  "releaseYear": 2014,
  "rating": 8.6
}

###

### UPDATE MOVIE
PUT http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 9.0
}

###

### DELETE MOVIE
DELETE http://localhost:3000/movies/1

###

### LLM SEARCH
POST http://localhost:3000/llm/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "funny sci-fi movies with robots"
}

###

### LLM RECOMMEND
POST http://localhost:3000/llm/recommend
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "a1b2c3d4",
  "hint": "I like emotional sci-fi movies about space exploration"
}